{"id": "DeuZO5YRIal", "title": "Video by neuronvisuals", "description": "The loudest room you’ll ever be in is a quiet bedroom at 3 AM.\n\nAt night there’s nothing left to do, so the mind finishes the day’s arguments without you: the past, family, money, the future, what everyone thinks. Nothing new happened. It just got louder, because nothing else is talking.\n\nMost of those fingers aren’t pointing at you. They’re your own guesses about what other people expect, played back in your own voice. It feels like a verdict. It’s usually a rerun.\n\nWhen it starts:\nWrite the loudest one down, so it has somewhere to go.\nAsk if you can do anything about it before morning.\nIf you can’t, give it an appointment in daylight, when it’s half the size.\n\nIf most nights go like this, it’s worth telling a doctor.\n\nWhich one keeps you up the longest?\n\nFollow @neuronvisuals for the nights your head won’t go quiet.", "channel": "neuronvisuals", "uploader_id": "54689343047", "uploader": "Neuron Visuals", "timestamp": 1792518160, "like_count": 283076, "comment_count": 570, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2149053609155787a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.866, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOefn3POw5-N196jP-t-6_C1AM0SOrjDXTRDXHgQh7jwYgNoiCxVtVTkZ7s99zM5RAJGLQSDA6VFO5-H-_zoAVw2ldaZ0a89B-9Ano.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=X-qMCeihixwQ7kNvwHB7tN6&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=BPB6KV5x7lz7DFUGZImVmw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQP3di9-Ko_LSBaEtfPCXJ_FMXpy5wdxSHWhi_iXi-bXJA&oe=6AE1CC69", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.866, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, li