rong", "timestamp": 1792956464, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "taniaalfaro.engineer", "author_id": "40191403232", "id": "18055766909812946", "text": "The \"write it down\" step has data behind it. In a Baylor study (Scullin et al., 2018), people who spent 5 minutes writing a specific to-do list before bed fell asleep faster than people who wrote about what they'd already done. Putting it on paper closes the loop the brain keeps running.", "timestamp": 1792942404, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thewanenonlyromdan", "author_id": "70015247819", "id": "18098378237398122", "text": "Bro that's why I make ramen at 3am", "timestamp": 1792934693, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeuZO5YRIal/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeuZO5YRIal", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/859059566_18046168271823048_56148321334397598_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=NDAxMjI1NTI5Mjg3OTU3MDU5NzE4MDQ2MTY4MjY4ODIzMDQ4.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=NhiSBpa-MO8Q7kNvwEaNglE&_nc_oc=AdpPm3jEqUJdKWHBK7mjIjqsxkrcTl8xD3y-OjQHUY8BthX-YdQxB2pn_WHvLSdBPFA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BPB6KV5x7lz7DFUGZImVmw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQPwN2GtwzsbXjgeBeVvteCFfIJ67LSz2E_iBUzAeqMGZg&oe=6AE5D63D", "display_id": "DeuZO5YRIal", "fulltitle": "Video by neuronvisuals", "upload_date": "20261020", "epoch": 1793064699, "format": "dash-2149076955820119v - 1440x2560 (DASH video)+dash-2149053609155787a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2149076955820119v+dash-2149053609155787a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 700.837, "width": 1440, "height": 2560, "resolution": "1440x2560", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.50.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 635.971, "aspect